WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.600
- We've been waiting for you.

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:03.163
All this time.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.163
Little did you know,

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.083
it would be me.

00:00:07.201 --> 00:00:09.951
(suspense music)

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:11.890
Hey, I'm Nick Jonas.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:12.940
I'm here at Buzzfeed.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.370
And today, we're having a staring contest.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:16.520
We got some ground rules.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.660
First person to blink loses.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.653
Talking or trashing talking is allowed.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.133
But most importantly,

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:25.780
no one knows they're having
a staring contest with me.

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:28.703
Let's do this.

00:00:29.684 --> 00:00:30.517
- Hello?

00:00:30.517 --> 00:00:32.140
It smells like somebody famous.

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:33.520
- [Man] Keep your eyes closed.

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:34.353
- Okay.

00:00:34.353 --> 00:00:35.953
- [Man] Take your blindfold off.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:37.393
- Oh, me.

00:00:37.393 --> 00:00:38.490
- [Man] Alright, here we go, ready?

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:39.323
- No.

00:00:39.323 --> 00:00:41.773
- [Man] Three, two, one, go.

00:00:42.877 --> 00:00:45.659
(nervous laughing)

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:46.583
- Hello.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.233
How are you?

00:00:49.233 --> 00:00:50.210
- Um, oh (bleep)!

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:51.623
No!

00:00:51.623 --> 00:00:52.456
No!

00:00:52.456 --> 00:00:53.740
I wanted this moment to last forever!

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:54.810
You can't kick me out, okay.

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.150
Oh my gosh, I don't know if you know this

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:58.473
but I was like the biggest
Jonas Brothers groupie.

00:00:58.473 --> 00:00:59.306
- Was?

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:00.383
- No, currently!

00:01:00.383 --> 00:01:01.216
Oh my gosh.

00:01:01.216 --> 00:01:02.049
Oh my gosh.

00:01:02.049 --> 00:01:02.910
Can I hug you?

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:04.313
Okay, thank you so much.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.190
- [Man] The only way you
lose is if you blink.

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:08.023
- Got it, okay.

00:01:08.023 --> 00:01:09.840
- [Man] Take your blindfold
off but keep your eyes closed.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:10.673
- Now?

00:01:10.673 --> 00:01:11.506
- [Man] Yep!

00:01:11.506 --> 00:01:13.503
Three, two, one, go.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:16.330
- Oh my God!

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:17.393
Okay, can't blink.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:18.443
- Welcome.

00:01:18.443 --> 00:01:19.276
Ah, I blinked.

00:01:19.309 --> 00:01:21.073
(yelling in excitement)

00:01:21.073 --> 00:01:22.293
(laughing)

00:01:22.293 --> 00:01:24.090
It's too long, the anticipation.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:24.923
- Hi!

00:01:24.923 --> 00:01:25.756
- How are you?

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:26.673
Good to see you.

00:01:26.673 --> 00:01:27.506
- Nice to meet you.

00:01:27.506 --> 00:01:28.339
- Sorry, I blinked so fast.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:29.463
- [Man] There we go.

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:31.652
Don't open your eyes, blindfold off, go.

00:01:31.652 --> 00:01:34.402
(suspense music)

00:01:35.944 --> 00:01:36.944
- Oh my God.

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:39.253
- Yes.

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:40.132
We'll give a hug.

00:01:40.132 --> 00:01:40.965
- Yes, oh my God.

00:01:40.965 --> 00:01:43.215
(laughing)

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:44.710
- Okay, I got it.

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:46.080
- [Man] From the second your eyes open,

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:47.980
you're trying to win a staring contest.

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:50.753
Three, two, one, go.

00:01:53.638 --> 00:01:55.888
(laughing)

00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:00.850
- They told me to look at your nose

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:02.503
but I made a big mistake.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:06.223
- You're eyes are really wide.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:07.563
- I know, I'm drying them out.

00:02:07.563 --> 00:02:08.396
I need Visine.

00:02:08.396 --> 00:02:10.293
- Do you do a mustache sometimes?

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:11.600
Or is it always the beard?

00:02:11.776 --> 00:02:13.863
- Sometimes you just gotta mix it up.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:15.230
It's usually the beard.

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:16.298
- Um, that's it.

00:02:16.298 --> 00:02:18.548
(laughing)

00:02:19.445 --> 00:02:20.278
Well done.

00:02:20.798 --> 00:02:23.048
(laughing)

00:02:27.772 --> 00:02:28.605
- [Man] Alrighty.

00:02:28.605 --> 00:02:29.438
- Oh, so much light.

00:02:29.438 --> 00:02:30.271
- [Man] Go.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:33.533
- Hello.

00:02:33.603 --> 00:02:34.497
- What's up?

00:02:34.497 --> 00:02:35.663
- I like your nails.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:37.600
- I like your jacket.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:39.883
- Ahh!

00:02:40.218 --> 00:02:42.357
(laughing)

00:02:42.357 --> 00:02:43.190
- Yes!

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:44.553
- Well done.

00:02:46.101 --> 00:02:47.018
Oh, thanks.

00:02:47.092 --> 00:02:49.342
(laughing)

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:52.316
- [Man] Bring it back.

00:02:52.316 --> 00:02:53.149
Good.

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:55.813
Three, two, one, go.

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.190
- We've been waiting for you.

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:00.763
All this time.

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:02.753
Little did you know,

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:04.633
it would be me.

00:03:06.551 --> 00:03:07.840
(laughing)

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:09.007
- [Man] Oh no.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:10.713
- I'm crying.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:12.033
Well done.

00:03:12.033 --> 00:03:12.866
- Thank you.

00:03:12.866 --> 00:03:13.699
- Well done.

00:03:13.699 --> 00:03:14.532
- Thank you.

00:03:14.532 --> 00:03:15.490
- I pushed myself to the limit.

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:20.050
- [Man] Alright, so Sarah.

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:21.123
- Yes.

00:03:21.123 --> 00:03:22.080
- [Man] Keep your eyes closed

00:03:22.197 --> 00:03:23.373
but you can take your blindfold off.

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:25.293
Go.

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:28.770
- That's what I was thinking.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:30.880
How are you today?

00:03:31.182 --> 00:03:32.682
- I'm good, how, oh I blinked.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.660
(laughing)

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:36.083
- It's so hard not to blink.

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:37.900
I felt your pain the whole time.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.920
- I practiced all day.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.290
- [Man] Shake hands with your competitor.

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:42.123
- Hey, well done.

00:03:42.123 --> 00:03:42.960
- A worthy opponent.

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:43.873
- Yeah.

00:03:43.873 --> 00:03:44.706
- Thank you.

00:03:44.706 --> 00:03:45.753
- That was a lot of fun.

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:48.380
Obviously, some very
memorable moments for me.

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:49.703
And for maybe them.

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:51.480
See ya next time.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:55.363
